+section('discover-keys experience-tabs  pb-0')
    .row.position-relative  
        .col.text-center
            +title('mb-4','Experience Life in Qatar')
        .row.new-tabs.mt-3
            .col
                .tabs-wrapper(role="tablist")
                    a(data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-lifestyle" class="new-btn-tab active" href="#") Lifestyle
                    a(data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-safety" class="new-btn-tab" href="#") Safety
                    a(data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-family" class="new-btn-tab" href="#") Family and Education
                    a(data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-moving" class="new-btn-tab" href="#") Moving to Qatar
            
                .tab-content 
                    .tab-pane.active#tab-lifestyle
                        .row 
                            
                            .col-lg-6.mb-4
                                .p-content
                                    h2.fs-24.fw-medium.text-secondary.mb-4 Pro-Business Environment
                                    p.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary The Qatar Financial Centre (QFC) has emerged as a regional FinTech hub in Qatar, supporting the country’s transformation into a digitally driven economy, as outlined in the Qatar National Vision 2030. In response to the rapid acceleration of global digitisation of trade, commerce and services, QFC has launched a series of innovative initiatives, including the QFC Tech Circle and QFC Tech Talk Series, that are designed to foster digital innovation, knowledge exchange, and entrepreneurship.<br><br> Companies in Qatar choose to set up with QFC to gain access to high-growth areas such as digital payments, SME-enabling technologies, InsurTech, RegTech and Islamic FinTech. With its business-friendly environment and regulatory support, QFC offers the ideal platform for local and international FinTechs seeking to scale across Qatar and the wider region.
                                
                                    a.btn.btn-transparent.mt-3(href="#")
                                        span.button-text Read More
                                            img(src="assets/images/icons/link-icon.svg", alt="link icon")
                            .col-lg-6.mb-4
                                figure 
                                    img(src="assets/images/sector.webp", class="img-fluid rounded-3")
